## 10. Stage 1 kernel selection (methods of the CNN section)

**Problem.**
- The cfg1 kernel size K was chosen by a near-tie.
- The CIFAR-10 cfg2 choice is not robust to dropping one screening seed.
- The CNN section must say this when it describes the configurations.

**Evidence.** [S1] T8, `T8_stage1_screen.csv`.
- cfg1 margin over the runner-up: MNIST {{tables.T8.mnist.cfg1_margin_pp:.2f}} pp, CIFAR-10 {{tables.T8.cifar10.cfg1_margin_pp:.2f}} pp.
