- CIFAR-10 cfg2 margin {{tables.T8.cifar10.cfg2_margin_pp:.2f}} pp, but it is kept only {{tables.T8.cifar10.loso_cfg2_same}}. Its score is driven
  by its own stress LR (0.01) being lower than that of the other candidates.

**Sentence for the CNN methods:**
> The kernel size of the standard CNN was chosen by a near-tie (margins of {{tables.T8.mnist.cfg1_margin_pp:.2f}} pp on both
> datasets) and should be read as one reasonable choice, not an optimum. The CIFAR-10 kernel-bank
> choice changes when either of two of the three screening seeds is dropped
> ({{tables.T8.cifar10.loso_cfg2_same}} kept), so cfg2 results on CIFAR-10 describe that configuration, not the best bank.

